name: sim.transformBuffer
description: Modifies a buffer than contains packed data
luaSynopsis: a) bytes outBuff = sim.transformBuffer(bytes inBuff, int inFormat, float mult, float off, int outFormat) b) list outBuff = sim.transformBuffer(bytes inBuff, sim.buffer_uint8, 0, int splitSize, sim.buffer_split)
pythonSynopsis: a) buffer outBuff = sim.transformBuffer(buffer inBuffer, int inFormat, float mult, float off, int outFormat) b) buffer[] outBuff = sim.transformBuffer(buffer inBuffer, sim.buffer_uint8, 0, int splitSize, sim.buffer_split)
inputs:
1. inBuff: input buffer that contains packed data
2. inFormat: buffer type
3. mult: multiplier value. We have out = offset + multiplier * in
4. off/splitSize: offset or split size value. We have out = offset + multiplier * in
5. outFormat: desired buffer type for the returned buffer
outputs:
1. a) outBuff: the modified buffer
2. b) outBuff: the various split buffers
